home-title = Bread calculators and science
home-description = Baker's percentages with levain, poolish and scalds, water temperature, yeast conversions: free bread-making calculators grounded in cited science.
home-heading = Bake by understanding, not by luck
home-lead = Calculators for bakers of every level: build a formula with levain, poolish or tangzhong, hit your dough temperature, convert yeast, and see why each number is what it is.
calculators-title = Bread calculators
calculators-description = Free bread-making calculators: baker's percentages with levain, poolish and scalds, fermentation time, starter feeding, water temperature and yeast conversion.
calculators-lead = Each calculator shows where its numbers come from, works without an account and keeps working offline.
home-knowledge = Learn and bake
home-principles = How Breadator works
home-principle-sources = Every rule and parameter comes from cited sources: scientific papers, The Sourdough Framework and tested bakers' methods.
home-principle-temperature = A fermentation time only means something at a given dough temperature: the calculators always ask for it.
home-principle-private = No account needed: calculations run in your browser, even offline.

