temperature-title = Water temperature calculator
temperature-description = Find the water temperature, or the ice, that gives your desired dough temperature.
temperature-lead = Dough temperature drives fermentation speed. Choose the dough temperature you want after mixing; Breadator works out the water temperature from the other ingredients.
