temperature-expected = Expected dough temperature after mixing:
temperature-explain = The heat balance weighs each ingredient by its mass and heat capacity (water stores about twice as much heat as flour). The classic rule gives every ingredient the same weight; its friction factor absorbs the difference.

yeast-title = Yeast converter
yeast-description = Convert between fresh, active dry and instant yeast, with the range manufacturers give.
yeast-lead = Dried yeasts hold about three times the dry matter of fresh yeast. Conversions are ranges: dried yeast loses some activity, and brands differ.
